# Škoda 120 Estelle four-door saloon, 1976-1990.
#
# The rear-engined Škoda 105/120, sold in Britain as the Estelle: 4,200 mm long,
# 1,610 mm wide, 1,400 mm high, 2,465 mm wheelbase; 1,046-1,174 cc
# overhead-valve four behind the rear axle. Cheap, roomy and much derided in the
# 1980s, with a large British following on price.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C5%A0koda_105/120
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Green are documented Škoda colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 60 in total (white 20, red 16, blue 14, green 10).
#
# Speed 150 km/h; comfort 45/398 (line). Classes 0,1,2.
# Dates: 1976-1990 with a road tail to about 1998.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/skoda-estelle.blend. References:
# citycars/references/skoda-estelle/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

obj=citycar
